o class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1076200/extras/919a48688ec4f0866933061f135b57e3.poster.avif?t=1764149292\" width=615 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1076200/extras/919a48688ec4f0866933061f135b57e3.webm?t=1764149292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
